# Three frontier models, each reviewing alone, on the same five test set pull requests:
# Go (9), Python (18), JavaScript (6), Java (12) and Rust (15), from a 2 KB diff to an 80 KB one.
# Claude Opus 5.5 verifies in every run, so the runs differ only in the reviewer.
solo-opus  9,18,6,12,15 RB_CONFIG_MODEL=anthropic/claude-opus-5.5 RB_CONFIG_VERIFIER=anthropic/claude-opus-5.5
solo-kimi  9,18,6,12,15 RB_CONFIG_MODEL=moonshotai/kimi-k3 RB_CONFIG_VERIFIER=anthropic/claude-opus-5.5
solo-astra 9,18,6,12,15 RB_CONFIG_MODEL=openai/gpt-6-astra RB_CONFIG_VERIFIER=anthropic/claude-opus-5.5
